# cloudflare-ddns runtime config (rendered into a hash-suffixed ConfigMap by the
# configMapGenerator, so any change here auto-rolls the pod — favonia reads these
# as env at startup).
#
# Everything in DOMAINS is PROXIED (orange-cloud) EXCEPT the grey list in PROXIED,
# which Cloudflare can't proxy: SIP (pbx), STUN/TURN (turn), VPN (netbird),
# RMM agent NATS (trmm), Minecraft (mc.*), SMTP is proxied, and echoip (ipleek,
# needs the real client IP). The fediverse hub is grey too: remote servers fetching
# it are bots by Cloudflare's reckoning, Bot Fight Mode cannot be scoped on this plan,
# and abuse handling on a social host needs the real client IP. The origin is already
# published by the records above, so proxying it would conceal nothing. The Matrix hosts
# are grey for the same reasons plus one of their own: the free plan caps a proxied request
# body at 100MB, which silently breaks media uploads and federation transfers above it.
# The call hosts join them: TURN is not HTTP and cannot be proxied at all, and the SFU's
# signalling is a long-lived WebSocket that gains nothing from a cache in front of it.
DOMAINS=arbitorium.com,cm.arbitorium.com,pm.arbitorium.com,astralfocus.com,ipleek.com,operationtimecapsule.com,mc.operationtimecapsule.com,optcp.com,outspokekin.com,social.outspokekin.com,chat.outspokekin.com,matrix.outspokekin.com,matrix-auth.outspokekin.com,livekit.outspokekin.com,matrix-call.outspokekin.com,turn.outspokekin.com,pcfae.com,kb.precisionplanit.com,prplanit.com,m.ntfy.prplanit.com,meshc.prplanit.com,netbird.prplanit.com,pbx.prplanit.com,trmm.prplanit.com,turn.prplanit.com,blog.sofmeright.com,ls.sofmeright.com,status.sofmeright.com,uni2.cc,meals.yesimvegan.com,wiki.yesimvegan.com,mc.yesimvegan.com
PROXIED=!is(pbx.prplanit.com,turn.prplanit.com,ipleek.com,netbird.prplanit.com,trmm.prplanit.com,mc.operationtimecapsule.com,mc.yesimvegan.com,outspokekin.com,social.outspokekin.com,chat.outspokekin.com,matrix.outspokekin.com,matrix-auth.outspokekin.com,livekit.outspokekin.com,matrix-call.outspokekin.com,turn.outspokekin.com)
IP4_PROVIDER=cloudflare.trace
IP6_PROVIDER=none
UPDATE_CRON=@every 5m
TZ=Etc/UTC
